<TITLE>Headlamp (Halogen Type)</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>The front turn signal light and clearance light are incorporated within the same lens as the headlight.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>By adopting projector-type headlights for the low beam headlights, excellent design and visibility have been achieved.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The L-shaped light has been divided vertically and each light has been laid out functionally. The bullet-shaped low beam and turn signal light are arranged vertically on the outer side of the vehicle to express strength.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The entire surface of the extension has been aluminum vapor-deposited.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>An actuator for manual leveling is installed on the back of the headlight body.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
